# Deny everything at the repository root, then allow only the static site.
# This prevents repository metadata, source, tests, and future root files from
# becoming public assets when `assets.directory` is the repository root.
*

!Assets/
!Assets/**
!CSS/
!CSS/**
!docs/
!docs/**
!docs-llm/
!docs-llm/**
!Fonts/
!Fonts/**
!_headers
!JS/
!JS/**
